OL,3,ASelf-described 'genocidal racist
OL,4,Amonster' jailed after BBC investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains graphic
OL,7,Faccounts of racist and violent language
OL,9,FA former tax worker who described
OL,10,Fhimself as "the ultimate genocidal
OL,11,Fracist monster" has been jailed for
OL,12,Finciting hatred online after he was
OL,13,Fexposed by a BBC investigation.
OL,15,FThomas Webster was sacked by HMRC and
OL,16,Finvestigated by police after comments
OL,17,Fhe made to an undercover journalist in
OL,18,Fthe BBC programme 'Unmasked: Extreme
OL,19,FFar Right'.
