OL,4,Amonster' jailed after BBC investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FWebster, 29, from Lapworth,
OL,7,FWarwickshire, admitted 10 counts of
OL,8,Fstirring up racial hatred online,
OL,9,Fincluding ones calling for the killing
OL,10,Fand extinction of his racial "enemies".
